                                margin-right:4px;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"3\"><var mathquill-command-id=\"8\" class=\"mq-operator-name\">c</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"9\" class=\"mq-operator-name\">o</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"10\" class=\"mq-operator-name mq-last\">s</var><span mathquill-command-id=\"12\">(</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"14\">2</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"16\">t</var><span mathquill-command-id=\"18\">)</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"20\" class=\"mq-binary-operator\">+</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"23\" class=\"mq-operator-name\">s</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"24\" class=\"mq-operator-name\">i</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"25\" class=\"mq-operator-name mq-last\">n</var><span mathquill-command-id=\"27\">(</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"29\">2</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"31\">t</var><span mathquill-command-id=\"33\">)</span></span></div></div></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center; border:qpx solid black; border-top:hidden;\"></td>\n</tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-incorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/incorrect-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-incorrectText\">Incorrect</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>We have a square matrix of dimension <mj